{113}{Glad to have you, sir. As you can see, they're holed up in the tanglewood, which, I'm happy to say only has one way out at the moment. Across this bridge. Ah, their body armour is tough, but it can be pierced with arrows or bullets. And if they get close enough, they cast a spell which I've heard called Charm.}{Glad to have you, lady. As you can see, they're holed up in the tanglewood, which, I'm happy to say only has one way out at the moment. Across this bridge. Ah, their body armour is tough, but it can be pierced with arrows or bullets. And if they get close enough, they cast a spell which I've heard called Charm.}{}{}{}{}
{114}{I see. Anything else?}{}{5}{}{115}{}
{115}{Well, we don't know how many of them there are inside the grove, but every now and then, I hear a kerfluffle goin' on. I have a feelin' they're getting hungry enough to start cannibalizing each other. So there might be only two or three left - or it could still be a dozen or two.}{Well, we don't know how many of them there are inside the grove, but every now and then, I hear a kerfluffle goin' on. I have a feelin' they're getting hungry enough to start cannibalizing each other. So there might be only two or three left - or it could still be a dozen or two.}{}{}{}{}
{116}{Let's hope it's the former rather than the latter. [You smile]}{}{5}{}{117}{}
{117}{Indeed! The less the better! }{Indeed! The less the better! }{}{}{}{}
